     "body": "<p>According to <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2016-04-07+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2016-04-07+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting</a>  and <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/gpB80SyXMek/-BBQuq1fBAAJ\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/fedora-tech/gpB80SyXMek/-BBQuq1fBAAJ</a>  They might use python for TCKs. This ticket is irreverent for the release testing.</p>\n\n<p>I was working on the release testing and create a project in <a href=\"https://github.com/yinlinchen/fcrepo4-release-tests\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/yinlinchen/fcrepo4-release-tests</a>  </p>",
